xt":["不着急，请坐，托马斯先生。以及，谢谢你的咖啡。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"24":{"step":[[24,25,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["你比原定时间晚到了八分钟，但那几乎没什么影响。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"25":{"step":[[25,26,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["在看完你的最新修改后，我意识到：预留三十分钟时间显得过于乐观，且毫无必要。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"26":{"step":[[26,27,""]],"type":1,"name":["作家托马斯","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"521101.png","audio":"7208590","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["你的意思是，它几乎不需要什么修改？看来我们可以直接——","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"27":{"step":[[27,28,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["其一，你的作品没法达到出版标准，托马斯先生。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"28":{"step":[[28,29,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["其二，你并不配合我的工作，托马斯先生。你保留了一部分我划去的删改，甚至还偷偷加了几个新句子。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"29":{"step":[[29,30,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["其三，我们可以把剩下的20分钟用于一些与你作品无关的谈论，比如新上映的电影《阿图埃尔河上的惨案》——我想，你能从中学到不少叙事的技巧。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"30":{"step":[[30,31,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["作家在编辑的连环炮击下败下阵来，他的满腔热情被一盆冷水浇灭，中途的驳辩之辞也已无从抒发。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"31":{"step":[[31,32,""]],"type":1,"name":["作家托马斯","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"521101.png","audio":"7208623","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["……好吧，好吧，我了解了，亨廷女士。你还真是一如既往地严苛。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"32":{"step":[[32,33,""]],"type":1,"name":["作家托马斯","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"521101.png","audio":"7208580","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["但，原谅我没法放弃我的作品，它是我走出心灵城堡的关键，我一定要想办法出版它。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"33":{"step":[[33,34,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["那么，祝你好运。另外，《惨案》的导演送了我不少电影票，我想你可以拿上一张去看看那部电影……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"34":{"step":[[34,35,""]],"type":1,"name":["作家托马斯","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"521101.png","audio":"7208620","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["在这之前，我希望你看看这个。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"35":{"step":[[35,36,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["男人将一直夹在腋下的小册子轻轻放在了实木桌面上，正巧压住了编辑拿出的电影票。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"36":{"step":[[36,37,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["这是什么？我为什么要看它？我特意把你放在最后一位，就是为了准时下班。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"37":{"step":[[37,38,""]],"type":1,"name":["作家托马斯","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"521101.png","audio":"7208640","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["猜猜我在来的路上遇到了什么？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"38":{"step":[[38,39,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["怎么，你遇到你最为崇拜的弗兰兹·卡夫卡了？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"39":{"step":[[39,40,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["他对于这种揶揄已经习以为常。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"40":{"step":[[40,41,""]],"type":1,"name":["作家托马斯","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"521101.png","audio":"7208630","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["……是一个头发有点乱的小女孩儿。她在咖啡店里打工，一闲下来就拿着一沓厚厚的册子，目光炯炯地，四处派发给感兴趣的顾客。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"41":{"step":[[41,42,""]],"type":1,"name":["作家托马斯","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"521101.png","audio":"7208580","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["怪异的是——那册子上没有出版商，没有上架类别，没有推荐导读，甚至连定价都没有。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"42":{"step":[[42,43,""]],"type":1,"name":["作家托马斯","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"521101.png","audio":"7208566","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["翻开之前，我本以为那是什么酒店传单、旅行册或是大学社团活动……却没想到，那竟然是一本小说！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"43":{"step":[[43,44,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["所以，写得好吗？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"44":{"step":[[44,45,""]],"type":1,"name":["作家托马斯","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"521101.png","audio":"7208592","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["好？不，完全不。但它很特别。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"45":{"step":[[45,46,""]],"type":1,"name":["作家托马斯","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"521101.png","audio":"7208595","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["总之，你读读它吧！那根本就要不了你十分钟。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"46":{"step":[[46,47,""]],"type":1,"name":["作家托马斯","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"521101.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["它不到一万字，却藏着某种魔力，就像是从潘多拉魔盒里跳出来的文学恶魔，一边学习人类的文字，一边拙略地模仿着人类作家的创作思路。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"47":{"step":[[47,48,""]],"type":1,"name":["作家托马斯","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"521101.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["那些难以厘清的隐喻，那种层层交叠的结构，老天——我很难相信它出自一位那样年轻的后辈之手。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"48":{"step":[[48,49,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["那我看看吧。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"49":{"step":[[49,50,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["安静的室内，只有风扇和烟草灼烧的声音。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"50":{"step":[[50,51,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["时间一分一秒地过去，铅笔的沙沙声开始徐徐响起，然后愈发频繁、愈发用力。<br>在某一刻，脆弱的笔芯发出了断裂的脆响。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"51":{"step":[[51,52,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["托马斯先生，我有一个不情之请。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"52":{"step":[[52,53,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["你能告诉这位……写得像梦游症患者一样的作者，邀请她在六点前到我这儿来碰面吗？她可真是个……能颠倒世界的“小天才”！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"53":{"step":[[53,54,""]],"type":1,"name":["作家托马斯","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"521101.png","audio":"7208558","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["哈哈！我说的没错吧！我是在街角那家咖啡店前遇见她的——如果运气好的话，她应该还在那儿才对。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/2_6/2_6_bg_bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"54":{"step":[[54,55,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["场景-办公室房间2","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"55":{"step":[[55,56,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["地标","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"56":{"step":[[56,57,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["办公室的门没关。青年作家兴冲冲地走进来，手上拿着一盒咖啡店的特价蜂蜜榅桲派。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"57":{"step":[[57,58,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["亨廷女士！听到是您要点名找我，真是个振奋人心的消息……我就知道无偿派发作品一定会迎来好结果的！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"58":{"step":[[58,59,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["听见自己的名字后，编辑抬起头，面色讶然。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"59":{"step":[[59,60,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["噢？你认识我？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"60":{"step":[[60,61,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311401.png","audio":"612601601","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["瓜达拉哈拉的图书博览会上，我曾在“天使故乡”出版社的展位上见过您。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"61":{"step":[[61,62,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["后来，有位作家朋友告诉我，您是“天使故乡”出版社的金字招牌——您尤其擅长帮助作家成名，甚至能够将作品改编成电影。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"62":{"step":[[62,63,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["如果当时就能跟您聊聊的话，也许我已经出版了不少小说……幸运的是，至少现在也不晚！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"63":{"step":[[63,64,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["慢着，我什么时候说要帮你出版小说了？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"64":{"step":[[64,65,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311401.png","audio":"612601602","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["嗯……？难道不是吗？毕竟您的原话是——“让我们把那位能颠倒世界的小天才请来”！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"65":{"step":[[65,66,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……是托马斯这么转述的吗？天呐。这就像他的作品一样，总是在应该直抒胸臆的地方大费周章。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"66":{"step":[[66,67,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["那您的目的究竟是……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"67":{"step":[[67,68,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["衣着考究的编辑走到窗前，打开了窗户。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"68":{"step":[[68,69,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["她点燃了一根烟。<br>车水马龙的嘈杂声席卷了室内，编辑的声音显得有些遥远。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"69":{"step":[[69,70,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["——放弃写作吧。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"70":{"step":[[70,71,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311401.png","audio":"612601603","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……什么？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"71":{"step":[[71,72,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["虚构集无法相信自己的耳朵。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"72":{"step":[[72,73,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["像你这样执拗于纯文学的家伙，不该活在属于电影的90年代。如果有种力量能让人回到过去，我真希望把你丢回30年前——那个充满火药味的拉丁美洲。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"73":{"step":[[73,74,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["编辑转过身，用食指关节轻轻地敲着桌面。她盯着虚构集，像课堂上严厉的教师。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"74":{"step":[[74,75,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["对于你自己的作品，你有足够清晰的想象吗？你的脑袋里有经过精心设计、滚瓜烂熟的结构吗？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"75":{"step":[[75,76,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我的想象非常清晰！我想再一次让人们谈论“本能现实主义”，再一次像60年代的作家前辈们那样，从稍纵即逝的事物中攫取永恒。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"76":{"step":[[76,77,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["编辑盯着虚构集，嘴角浮现出一丝复杂的笑容。她掐灭烟，重新坐回办公桌前。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"77":{"step":[[77,78,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我换个问法。你想写出让读者们能够读懂的好作品，对吗？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"78":{"step":[[78,79,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311401.png","audio":"612601604","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["是的，亨廷女士。可我觉得，在兼顾文学性的同时很难做到这一点……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"79":{"step":[[79,80,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["别心急，坐下。我已经读过了你的小说。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"80":{"step":[[80,81,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["编辑将小册子递了过来，虚构集的视线立刻被上面满满的修改线所吸引。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"81":{"step":[[81,82,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["<i>“在故乡的天空下，牧童们的影子比他们的身躯还要巨大”</i>——这一句还不错，很有画面感。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"82":{"step":[[82,83,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311401.png","audio":"612601605","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……唔？嗯嗯！在那之后，牛仔会遇到一个没有影子的牧童，他并未意识到那个牧童的影子就是他自己……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"83":{"step":[[83,84,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["<i>“每当夕阳西沉，他们的轮廓便被拉长成山脊上的巨兽，挥舞着牧鞭驱赶那些并不存在的牛群。”</i>——这就显得有些多余。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"84":{"step":[[84,85,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["何况，读者怎么会知道这里的牛群是一种隐喻呢？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"85":{"step":[[85,86,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311401.png","audio":"612601606","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……好吧。但在这里为读者埋下怀疑的种子，才能在故事高潮带来一次美妙的恍然大悟！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"86":{"step":[[86,87,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["那么，再看这里，看这行线——","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"87":{"step":[[87,88,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["<i>“这些牛从不低头吃草，它们追着星辰跑，直到把牧童的灵魂也一并拖走。<br>谁也别妄想回到故乡，那里的土地会咬人，咬得你再也走不掉。”</i>","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"88":{"step":[[88,89,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["你为什么要写下它？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"89":{"step":[[89,90,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311401.png","audio":"612601607","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["这……这是跟牛群的呼应。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"90":{"step":[[90,91,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我并不是在质疑句子本身，它很有风格……但，你的主题呈现到哪儿去了？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"91":{"step":[[91,92,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["这分明是一个讲述主人公在多年后回到故乡，在陌生化的体验中展现魔幻现实的故事。为什么到了第五页，我还是只能看到牧童和牛群？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"92":{"step":[[92,93,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311401.png","audio":"612601608","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["您说得对，但……这是主题的一部分！其实牧童跟主人公小时候长得一模一样——他其实就是主人公儿童时代的幻影，只是主人公已经认不出来了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"93":{"step":[[93,94,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["噢，是个有趣的想法。但我要从何处得知呢？让我们往后翻一翻，一直翻到……三十七页。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"94":{"step":[[94,95,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["小天才，你用了整整三十七页，只是为了告诉读者：前五页的牧童是一个镜像的象征？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"95":{"step":[[95,96,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["也许您说得对，我的确需要好好调整一些结构才是……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"96":{"step":[[96,97,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["文学不是童话，也不是一场私人梦境。你以为光靠想象力就能征服读者吗？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"97":{"step":[[97,98,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["一个建议——趁着年轻，学一学怎么写电影剧本吧。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"98":{"step":[[98,99,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["虚构集露出了困惑而茫然的神情。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"99":{"step":[[99,100,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311401.png","audio":"612601609","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["可……可我不明白，电影剧本跟文学真的有关系吗？我电影看的不多，还总是在电影院睡着……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"100":{"step":[[100,101,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["这只是一个建议，一个最极端的建议。我只是想告诉你，别把故事性不当一回事。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"101":{"step":[[101,102,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["天色暗得很快。然而，一场漫长的拉力才刚刚开始。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshi.jpg","choice":[]},"102":{"step":[[102,103,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["场景-办公室昏暗","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"103":{"step":[[103,104,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["地标","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"104":{"step":[[104,105,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["当虚构集头晕目眩地抬起头时，时钟已经指向了八点过一刻。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"105":{"step":[[105,106,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["噢，竟然已经这么晚了！抱歉耽误了您的时间……但，真是一次酣畅淋漓的文学探讨！谢谢您！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"106":{"step":[[106,107,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["亨廷用拇指和食指揉了揉眼角，身体疲惫地向椅子上靠去。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"107":{"step":[[107,108,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["不得不承认的是：对于虚构集，她心中的印象发生了一些改观。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"108":{"step":[[108,109,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["这没什么。何况，我认识了一位像你这样不守常规的神奇作家。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"109":{"step":[[109,110,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["呼……今天就先这样。回去思考一下这三个问题：","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"110":{"step":[[110,111,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["其一，为什么牛仔要回到故乡？其二，为什么遇到吹泡泡的牧童？其三，为什么角色会知道连作者本人都不知道的事？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"111":{"step":[[111,112,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311401.png","audio":"612601610","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["您的意思是……？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"112":{"step":[[112,113,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["虚构集的失落与疲惫顿时烟消云散。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"113":{"step":[[113,114,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["她意识到，她已经得到了许多宝贵的建议。与朋友们七嘴八舌的议论完全不同——那是一位专业的出版社编辑给她的建议。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"114":{"step":[[114,115,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["所以，您的意思是，如果我按照您的建议修改，并再来打扰您的话，我的小说就有出版的机会吗？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"115":{"step":[[115,116,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["那得看你能改成什么样了。我可没法打包票。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"116":{"step":[[116,117,""]],"type":1,"name":["虚构集","","Recoleta","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311401.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我只需要两周……不，一周，就能让您看到一版面貌全新的作品！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"117":{"step":[[117,118,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……如果可以的话，下次，我希望你去前台大厅预约一下。至少让我知道你来过。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"118":{"step":[[118,119,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["她对眼前的青年作家并不抱有多么大的期待。夸大其词是作家特有的脾性，多年积累的职业素养如此提醒着她。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/bangongshihunan.jpg","choice":[]},"119":{"step":[[119,120,""]],"type":1,"name":["编辑亨廷","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"523801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["加